Hey, I can't wait anymore! I don't need anything except for you!

101
00:18:15,181 --> 00:18:20,641
絶対アイドル辞めないで ずっと
Never stop being an idol... forever!

102
00:18:21,121 --> 00:18:27,661
輝いてる君を見たい もう ずっとずっとずっと ステージにいて
I want to see you shining bright... stay on stage forever and ever!

103
00:18:41,121 --> 00:18:49,101
私がもし君の元から離れたなら 君はちょっと寂しくなるかな
If I were to drift away from you like this, I wonder if you would feel a little lonely?

104
00:18:49,601 --> 00:18:52,621
意地悪と笑う
Or smile at me teasingly?

105
00:18:52,941 --> 00:18:57,241
好きな人がいるのなら 内緒にしてね
If there's someone you like, keep it a secret, okay?

106
00:18:57,441 --> 00:19:03,561
ねぇ 神様は 将来という未来を どこかに隠してる
Hey, God hides our future somewhere...

107
00:19:04,421 --> 00:19:11,961
君の好きに合わせたんだ 髪の色 私の中 君だけで
I matched my hair color to your preferences. With you alone inside me...

108
00:19:12,701 --> 00:19:19,621
片想い中途半端で 責任取ってね 大好きです
Half-hearted unrequited love... take responsibility! I love you so much!

109
00:19:24,021 --> 00:19:29,141
絶対アイドル辞めないで
Never stop being an idol!

110
00:19:31,001 --> 00:19:36,641
優しい目も 真面目な顔も 全て知ってる私が言う
Even your gentle gaze and serious face... As someone who knows everything, I say:

111
00:19:37,001 --> 00:19:40,981
絶対 そうなれ 輝いて
You definitely shine brighter than anyone!

112
00:19:43,781 --> 00:19:49,101
星は瞬いた 鮮やかに 眩しい君が世界一だよ
The stars are twinkling brilliantly. You, shining so brightly, are number one in the world!

113
00:20:00,456 --> 00:20:02,176
絶対アイドル辞めないで
Never stop being an idol!

114
00:20:02,296 --> 00:20:06,896
君の夢は何ですか？教えて欲しい
What is your dream? Please tell me.

115
00:20:07,796 --> 00:20:13,676
その夢がアイドルじゃなくても 覚悟はしてるから
Even if that dream isn't being an idol, I'm prepared for it.

116
00:20:14,396 --> 00:20:19,936
星のいない空 それが当たり前で
A sky without stars, accepting that as normal...

117
00:20:20,216 --> 00:20:22,796
暗い道に目が慣れずに
My eyes couldn't adjust to the dark path,

118
00:20:23,056 --> 00:20:25,976
踏み出すのも怖かった
and taking a step forward was terrifying.

119
00:20:26,596 --> 00:20:29,936
そんな時 やっと見えた光
But at that moment, I finally saw the light.

120
00:20:34,336 --> 00:20:39,156
絶対 君は歌ってて
You will definitely keep singing,

121
00:20:40,036 --> 00:20:46,636
ただのエゴとわかってても 君はキラキラ衣装が似合う！
no matter how selfish it is, you look so dazzling in your stage outfit!

122
00:20:47,156 --> 00:20:50,196
絶対 大きなステージで
Definitely on a big stage,

123
00:20:50,956 --> 00:20:55,276
一列でも前で感じたい 今日の歌い方
even if it's the front row, I want to feel it—I love the way you sing today

124
00:20:55,716 --> 00:21:00,096
なんか好きだなあ
somehow, I just love it.

125
00:21:00,956 --> 00:21:06,236
君の努力 私の愛 成り立つ この関係は
Your efforts and my love—this relationship works because

126
00:21:07,076 --> 00:21:12,476
強くて脆いの 星の幸せを願った
we're strong yet fragile, wishing for the star's happiness.

127
00:21:12,836 --> 00:21:21,936
だけどね だって君はアイドルよ（ずっと）
But you know... because you're an idol, forever!

128
00:21:23,876 --> 00:21:29,456
初めて目が合った日から 今日も明日も君ばかりだ
Ever since the day our eyes first met, today and tomorrow, it's all about you!

129
00:21:29,896 --> 00:21:33,296
絶対アイドル辞めないで
Definitely never stop being an idol!

130
00:21:34,856 --> 00:21:40,136
これは報われないおとぎ話 恋よりも もっと好きだ
This is an unrequited fairy tale, I love you even more than mere romance.

131
00:21:40,496 --> 00:21:44,736
魔法よどうか解けないままで
Magic, please stay unbroken forever!

132
00:22:14,396 --> 00:22:20,156
UNHAPPY? 悩める人の子よ UNLUCKY? 人成らざる者も BE HAPPY! 弛まず目せよ 生きているんだし
Unhappy? Troubled children of humanity. Unlucky? Non-human beings too. Be happy! Keep aiming without hesitation—you're alive after all!

133
00:22:20,516 --> 00:22:26,036
目を逸らした過去も 退屈な未来も カウンセリング やれやれ 古今東西 ピースピース
The past you averted your eyes from, the boring future, counseling, oh well—universal peace and quiet!

134
00:22:26,616 --> 00:22:27,796
ここんとこは行き詰まり気味
Things have hit a dead end lately.

135
00:22:28,236 --> 00:22:32,536
アンデッドアンデッドアンデッドアンデッド
Undead, undead, undead, undead!

136
00:22:40,956 --> 00:22:44,676
ねえなんだかどうして 戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
Hey, hey, hey, hey, why does it feel like I'm constantly fighting?

137
00:22:45,436 --> 00:22:54,536
触れられない 触れたくもない 過去の自分自分自分自分と もうとっくに死んでる 透明な亡霊と対決 幼気で痛い記憶の奥
The past self I can't touch or even bear to face, long dead, facing off with a transparent phantom deep within painful, innocent memories.

138
00:22:54,876 --> 00:23:00,716
残念？ もう居いないのに あれ？ そっちがいい？ アイロニーね 透かされているのは今の自分？
Too bad? Even though you're no longer here. Huh? That side is better? How ironic—is my present self being seen right through?

139
00:23:01,076 --> 00:23:07,456
ナンセンス 消えないレッテル Yes! 要はコンプレックス 取り憑かれているみたい
Nonsense, a label that won't fade. Yes! In short, it's a complex, like I'm possessed.

140
00:23:07,756 --> 00:23:13,156
巻き付いたまま まだ離れない 在りし日の自分
Still wrapped around me, refusing to let go—my former self.

141
00:23:13,296 --> 00:23:20,396
UNDEAD 死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖 生きていることとは変わり続けることだ
Undead! You aren't dead, you and your chain. To be alive is to keep changing.

142
00:23:20,896 --> 00:23:27,876
不幸に甘んじて 満足するなよ 幸せになろうとしないなんて卑怯だ
Don't just surrender to misfortune and be satisfied—refusing to try and be happy is cowardly.

143
00:23:28,156 --> 00:23:39,156
この世この世は 奇怪奇怪ファンタジー 次は鬼が出るか蛇が出るか 出会って遭ってやっと始まる物語 さあ人か化物か
This world is a bizarre fantasy! Next, will an ogre appear or a snake? Meeting and finally beginning our story—now, are you human or a monster?

144
00:23:40,036 --> 00:23:41,356
ピースピース
Peace, peace!

145
00:23:41,496 --> 00:23:48,376
Past & Future can't change the Past Past & Future run for the Future カットイン
Past & Future, can't change the past, Past & Future, run for the future—cut-in!

146
00:23:48,496 --> 00:23:53,676
なんだかどうして 未来になんぞ 何の希望もない期待出来ないような気がして
Somehow, why does it feel like there's no hope or expectation for the future at all?

147
00:23:54,236 --> 00:24:00,796
もう随分生きている 既視感とテンプレで食傷 素敵な出来事の気配もない
Having lived quite long enough, suffering from déjà vu and templates, not even a hint of wonderful events.

148
00:24:01,116 --> 00:24:06,176
残念 積んだ経験の因果 形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
Regrettable—the karma of piled experience, ossified myths and boring evolution.

149
00:24:06,536 --> 00:24:13,836
要は刺激が欲しいんだ 飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった なんて 整っていくガイダンス 増えるコンプライアンス 蓋されていくみたい
The point is I want stimulation! "I'm bored, I'm used to it," guiding lights falling into place, increasing compliance, feeling capped off.

150
00:24:14,116 --> 00:24:19,536
吸い尽くして あれもどれもこれも 同じ味がする
Sucking them all dry—this, that, and everything tastes the same.

151
00:24:19,836 --> 00:24:27,276
UNDEAD 死んじゃいない お前とお前の連鎖 何時の世も 過去も未来も現在にあるんだ
Undead! You aren't dead, you and your chain. Any era, past and future alike, all exist in the present!

152
00:24:27,716 --> 00:24:35,436
生きていることを 愚直に果たせよ 目指せハッピーエンド
Faithfully fulfill being alive! Aim for a happy end.

153
00:24:35,576 --> 00:24:47,856
お前に言っているんだ 幸せを諦めてしまうな 人で在れ ただ苦しみに慣れて 耐えているだけじゃ 死んでいるも同然 屍のアンデッド
I'm talking to you! Don't give up on happiness—remain truly human. Just getting used to suffering and enduring it is practically being dead, a corpse undead!

154
00:24:48,436 --> 00:24:53,376
UNHAPPY? 悩める人の子よ UNLUCKY? 人成らざる者も BE HAPPY! 弛まず目せよ 生きているんだろ
Unhappy? Troubled children of humanity. Unlucky? Non-human beings too. Be happy! Keep aiming without hesitation—you're alive after all!

155
00:24:53,896 --> 00:24:59,436
不幸に浸かるも 幸せになるのも そう全部全部お前だ
Whether soaking in misfortune or becoming happy, yes, it's all, all up to you!

156
00:26:07,544 --> 00:26:11,944
真夜中に告ぐ 音の警告
A warning sound proclaimed in the dead of night...

157
00:26:11,944 --> 00:26:15,644
協和音に酔う 午前零時
Drunk on consonant chords at midnight.

158
00:26:16,194 --> 00:26:20,894
あなたが触れる 光増す熱 指先に踊らされ
Heat increasing on fingertips as you touch, making them dance.

159
00:26:21,394 --> 00:26:27,794
感覚 即 体感 寝静まる夜 二人だけの蜜
Instant sensation, physical feeling, a sleeping night, just the two of us' sweetness.

160
00:26:28,094 --> 00:26:34,894
体感 即 快感 重なる波形に魅了されていく
Instant physical feeling, pleasure, being charmed by overlapping waveforms.

161
00:26:35,294 --> 00:26:42,094
忘れないでね わたしの声を 画面越しでいい ちゃんと愛して
Don't forget my voice... through the screen is fine, love me properly.

162
00:26:42,094 --> 00:26:49,094
ヴァーチャルだって 突き放さないで あなたの音に まだ溺れていたい
Even if it's virtual, don't push me away, I want to keep drowning in your sound.

163
00:26:49,094 --> 00:26:56,094
覚えていてね わたしの声を あなたがくれた この身すべてを
Remember my voice... all of this body you gave me.

164
00:26:56,094 --> 00:27:02,594
見つめ合う あなたと二人 重ねた息と音とヒビカセ
Gazing at each other, just you and me, letting our overlapping breath and sound echo.

165
00:27:16,094 --> 00:27:22,294
真夜中に問う 冷え切った熱 待ち続けてる
A chilling heat questioned in the middle of the night, waiting patiently.

166
00:27:22,294 --> 00:27:29,294
午前零時 鏡写しに 飽和していく 知らない音が伝う
At midnight, saturated like a mirror image, unknown sounds are transmitted.

167
00:27:30,094 --> 00:27:36,594
感覚 即 体感 寝静まる夜と息遣い揃う
Sensation, instant physical feeling, a sleeping night and breathing matching.

168
00:27:36,894 --> 00:27:43,094
体感 即 快感 錆びたロジック「今一度」を焦がれる
Physical feeling, instant pleasure, yearning for rusted logic "once more."

169
00:27:43,394 --> 00:27:50,894
忘れないでね わたしの声を 次元も越えて 飛ばすシグナル
Don't forget my voice, transcending dimensions, sending a signal.

170
00:27:50,894 --> 00:27:57,894
ヴァーチャルだなんて言わないで あなたの音に まだ愛されていたい
Don't say it's just virtual, I want to still be loved by your sound.

171
00:27:57,894 --> 00:28:04,894
覚えていてね わたしの声を あなたがくれた この身すべてを
Remember my voice... all of this body you gave me.

172
00:28:04,894 --> 00:28:11,594
言の葉と初の音が交わる この息と音とヒビカセ
Words and first sounds intersect, with this breath and sound echoing.

173
00:28:11,594 --> 00:28:17,894
あなたの生んだ音に ただ恋をしていたの
I was simply falling in love with the sound you created.

174
00:28:18,294 --> 00:28:24,894
悲しみ 怒り 甘心 すべて打ち鳴らす
Beating away all sorrow, anger, and sweetness.

175
00:28:25,094 --> 00:28:38,594
絶えず叫ぶ 声連ねる 余熱交ぜる 愛、絶 艶めく
Endlessly shouting, stringing voices together, mixing residual heat, love, exquisitely dazzling.

176
00:28:52,094 --> 00:28:59,094
魅了されていく 忘れないでね わたしの声を
Being charmed... don't forget my voice.

177
00:28:59,094 --> 00:29:06,594
画面越しでいい ちゃんと愛して ヴァーチャルだって
Through the screen is fine, love me properly, even if it's virtual...

178
00:29:06,594 --> 00:29:14,094
突き放さないで あなたの音に まだ溺れていたい 覚えていてね
Don't push me away, I want to keep drowning in your sound. Remember...

179
00:29:14,094 --> 00:29:21,094
わたしの声を あなたがくれた この身すべてを
My voice... all of this body you gave me.

180
00:29:21,094 --> 00:29:35,094
見つめ合う あなたと二人 重ねた息と音を響かせ 音響かせ
Gazing at each other, just you and me, let our overlapping breath and sound echo... Let the sound echo.

181
00:29:35,094 --> 00:29:49,094
オトヒビカセ オトヒビカセ オトヒビカセ
Let the sound echo... Let the sound echo...

182
00:32:06,946 --> 00:32:11,826
ブラック★ロックシューター 何処へ行ったの
Black Rock Shooter, where did you go?

183
00:32:12,386 --> 00:32:14,786
聞こえますか
Can you hear me?

184
00:32:15,186 --> 00:32:18,226
真っ直ぐ
Straight...

185
00:32:19,469 --> 00:32:22,869
[Title: ブラック★ロックシューター]
[Title: Black Rock Shooter]

186
00:32:31,069 --> 00:32:35,869
あとどれだけ叫べばいいのだろう
How much more do I have to scream?

187
00:32:37,069 --> 00:32:41,569
あとどれだけ泣けばいいのだろう
How much more do I have to cry?

188
00:32:43,069 --> 00:32:47,069
もうやめて 私はもう走れない
Stop already, I can't run anymore.

189
00:32:49,069 --> 00:32:53,569
いつか夢見た世界が閉じる
The world I dreamed of someday is closing.

190
00:32:57,269 --> 00:33:02,069
真っ暗で明かりもない
In pitch darkness with no light...

191
00:33:02,369 --> 00:33:07,069
崩れかけたこの道で
On this crumbling road...

192
00:33:07,569 --> 00:33:11,869
あるはずもない あの時の希望が見えた気がした
I felt like I saw the hope of that time which shouldn't even exist.

193
00:33:18,069 --> 00:33:23,569
どうして ブラック★ロックシューター 懐かしい記憶
Why, Black Rock Shooter... such nostalgic memories.

194
00:33:24,069 --> 00:33:29,069
ただ楽しかった あの頃を
Those times when we were just having fun...

195
00:33:30,069 --> 00:33:34,569
ブラック★ロックシューター でも動けないよ
Black Rock Shooter, but I can't move.

196
00:33:35,069 --> 00:33:40,069
闇を駆ける星に願いを
Whispering my wish to the star racing through the darkness.

197
00:33:40,569 --> 00:33:45,069
もう一度だけ 走るから
I'll run just one more time.

198
00:33:59,069 --> 00:34:09,069
怖くて震える声でつぶやく わたしの名前を呼んで
With a voice trembling with fear, I mutter—call my name.

199
00:34:10,069 --> 00:34:18,569
夜明けを抱く空 境界線までの距離 あともう一歩届かない
The sky embracing the dawn, the distance to the boundary line, still not reaching by one more step.

200
00:34:22,069 --> 00:34:26,569
こらえた涙があふれそうなの
The tears I held back are about to overflow...

201
00:34:27,069 --> 00:34:30,569
今下を向かないで 止まってしまう
Don't look down now, or it will stop...

202
00:34:33,069 --> 00:34:43,069
未来を生きていたいんだ わかったの 思い出して 強く 強く 信じるの
I want to live for the future, I understand now—remember and believe strongly, strongly.

203
00:34:46,569 --> 00:34:51,069
そうよ ブラック★ロックシューター 優しい匂い
That's right, Black Rock Shooter, a gentle scent...

204
00:34:51,569 --> 00:34:56,569
痛いよ 辛いよ 飲み込む言葉
It hurts, it's painful, words swallowed down.

205
00:34:57,069 --> 00:35:00,117
ブラック★ロックシューター 動いてこの足！
Black Rock Shooter, move, my legs!

206
00:35:00,234 --> 00:35:01,884
私は絶対
I will definitely...

207
00:35:02,224 --> 00:35:07,924
この壁を越えて
go beyond this wall...

208
00:35:32,034 --> 00:35:35,604
最初からわかっていた
I knew it from the start...

209
00:35:36,264 --> 00:35:42,714
ここにいることを
That I was meant to be right here.

210
00:35:43,204 --> 00:35:51,814
わたしのなかの 全ての勇気が火をともして
All the courage inside of me sparks a flame...

211
00:35:52,384 --> 00:35:54,794
もう逃げないよ
I won't run away anymore.

212
00:35:55,364 --> 00:35:59,934
ブラックロックシューター ひとりじゃないよ
Black Rock Shooter, you're not alone.

213
00:36:00,394 --> 00:36:05,594
声をあげて泣いたって構わない
It's okay to cry out loud.

214
00:36:06,794 --> 00:36:11,514
ブラックロックシューター 見ていてくれる
Black Rock Shooter, you're watching over me.

215
00:36:12,424 --> 00:36:17,524
今からはじまるの
It's beginning right now...

216
00:36:18,124 --> 00:36:22,684
わたしの物語
My own story.

217
00:36:39,234 --> 00:36:46,524
忘れそうになったら この歌を 歌うの
Whenever I'm about to forget, I'll sing this song.

218
00:36:57,234 --> 00:36:58,874
[Sign: Beyond the way]

219
00:37:00,234 --> 00:37:06,624
息つまるばかりで 温い退屈な夜道で
In a suffocating, lukewarm, boring night road...

220
00:37:07,234 --> 00:37:12,874
ルールは無視で行きたいね あーあ
I want to go ignoring the rules, ah-ah...

221
00:37:13,234 --> 00:37:15,074
So burn, my burn, my heart

222
00:37:15,234 --> 00:37:19,074
Ooh, ooh, ooh 悟られそう
Ooh, ooh, ooh about to be found out...

223
00:37:19,534 --> 00:37:22,374
Oo-ooh, ooh 可かふか get down now
Oo-ooh, ooh get down now...

224
00:37:27,034 --> 00:37:29,974
もうきっと 優等ぶった"I"じゃ居られないくらい
By now, I can't stay as a goody-two-shoes 'I' anymore...

225
00:37:30,434 --> 00:37:31,374
どうしようもない
There's nothing we can do.

226
00:37:31,734 --> 00:37:34,374
Yeah 無理目のクエスチョン Huh 実存？ フィクション？
Yeah, a tough question / Huh, existence? Fiction?

227
00:37:34,734 --> 00:37:37,574
You make me サゲなのなんで？
You make me feel down, why?

228
00:37:37,874 --> 00:37:39,174
I know the way

229
00:37:39,174 --> 00:37:44,074
願ってるばっかじゃ叶わない めちゃくちゃにされたって変わらない
Just wishing won't make it come true, even if it's messed up, nothing changes

230
00:37:44,374 --> 00:37:46,074
まあね 喰ラエ 覚醒 Find the way
Well then, take it, awakening, find the way

231
00:37:46,434 --> 00:37:52,074
待ってライトあびる感覚甘い罠 見当違いdisも聞き飽きたわ
Wait, the sensation of taking the spotlight is a sweet trap, I'm sick of misguided disses

232
00:37:52,374 --> 00:37:57,574
そりゃねいけるところまで take me higher
Naturally, take me higher as far as we can go

233
00:37:58,034 --> 00:38:03,374
どど どう？ Turning back 無理って とっくに分かってんでしょ
How, how? Turning back is impossible, you've known that all along, right?

234
00:38:03,934 --> 00:38:09,274
Ooh, ooh, ooh 悟られそう Oo-ooh, ooh 可かふか get down now
Ooh, ooh, ooh about to be found out / Oo-ooh, ooh get down now

235
00:38:09,734 --> 00:38:15,474
もうずっとしゃんと居られないや それは誰のせい？
I can't stand straight anymore / Whose fault is that?

236
